<title>USA: Sunbeam hopes to have statement later.</title>
<headline>Sunbeam hopes to have statement later.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A spokeswoman for Sunbeam Corp said the company could provide no immediate comment on a report in Monday's Wall Street Journal that its chairman, Albert Dunlap was exploring options, including a possible sale of the firm or making a large acquisition, but she said the company hoped to have a statement at some time on Monday.</p>
<p>Sunbeam's shares were up 1/8 to 33 on 304,700-share volume in late morning trading.</p>
